      "kind": "change",
      "passage": "Industry estimates put cement demand to grow closer to 10% year -on-year. Our growth of 13.8% this quarter is comfortably ahead, which means that our presence in the market is continuously increasing. North markets grew in high double digits. We have grown more than 20% in the Northern markets, in the range of 15% to 20% in the Southern markets, East around 5%, West around closer to 10% as well as 10% in the Central markets. Our capacity utilization was 71%, better than 66% last year on a higher base. We could have grown more. We could have sold more cement if additional capacity was available.",
